    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Cleric 4</p><p>Any cure spells a cleric casts on himself are automatically empowered as if by the Empower Spell feat, except they do not cost additional MP. If the cleric targets himself with a cure spell that affects multiple creatures (E.g., Cura), this ability only applies to himself. At 8th level, he can select this talent again, allowing him to choose between applying either the Empower Spell or the Maximize Spell feat on his cure spells that affects himself.</p>",
